//   - The memory card starts empty every time (photos, memos and backups made
//     in the emulator last until it is reloaded). The flash (settings,
//     contacts, messages, notes...) is kept in the emulator's storage.
//   - The camera sees the emulator's green grain, so the QR reader finds no code.
//   - Music has no songs (no files on the card, and the MP3 decoder is a
